###
@hospitalId = {{reception.response.body.user.hospitalId}}

### 2. Reception dashboard: appointments, patients, billing. NO clinical or pharmacy (null)
GET {{baseUrl}}/hospitals/{{hospitalId}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{reception.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Doctor dashboard: only HIS appointments and records. billing must be null
GET {{baseUrl}}/hospitals/{{hospitalId}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{doctor.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Accountant dashboard: billing only. appointments, patients, clinical must be null
GET {{baseUrl}}/hospitals/{{hospitalId}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{accountant.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. Admin dashboard: every section filled
GET {{baseUrl}}/hospitals/{{hospitalId}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6. Billing patient lookup: identity fields only (no allergies, no history)
GET {{baseUrl}}/hospitals/{{hospitalId}}/invoices/patients?q=Okon
Authorization: Bearer {{accountant.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7. Lookup with 1 character returns an empty list, not the whole registry
GET {{baseUrl}}/hospitals/{{hospitalId}}/invoices/patients?q=a
Authorization: Bearer {{accountant.response.body.accessToken}}

### 8. Doctor tries the billing lookup: expect 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/hospitals/{{hospitalId}}/invoices/patients?q=Okon
Authorization: Bearer {{doctor.response.body.accessToken}}

### 9. Unpaid invoices only (ISSUED + PARTIALLY_PAID + OVERDUE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/hospitals/{{hospitalId}}/invoices?status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{accountant.response.body.accessToken}}

### 10. Invalid status: expect 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/hospitals/{{hospitalId}}/invoices?status=MAYBE
Authorization: Bearer {{accountant.response.body.accessToken}}